arn with milestones designed to help you to achieve learning outcomes.",Nz="By completing this plan, you\u2019ll achieve the following learning outcomes:",$z="Start your plan today!",Up="View progress",Uz="Download this file to view a list of learners and their progress.",RP="Download CSV",Oz="The file contains the following information:",qz="Learner group",Fz="Learn username",Hz="Start date",zz="End date",Bz="Items completed",Yz="Items total",Dx="Learning outcomes",Vz="Edit learning outcomes",Gz="A learning outcome is specific knowledge, skills, or expertise that the learner will get from completing this plan.",jz="Tip: Begin each learning outcome with a verb. Each outcome should finish the sentence \u201CUpon completion of this plan, learners will be able to...\u201D";var Wz="Outcome 1",Qz="Outcome 2 (optional)",Kz="Outcome 3 (optional)",Jz="Outcome {number}",Xz="Convert to an official plan",Zz="Convert a plan to an official plan",eB="An official plan should be used when you want your plan to <strong>represent Microsoft</strong> and if you would like to include links that are external to Microsoft Learn. Always ensure that your plan is complete, free of typographical errors, and that content is in the correct sequence. <strong>Once an official plan is published, it cannot be altered.</strong>",tB="To preserve any external links from an underlying Official Collection or plan, please convert to an official plan.",oB="An official plan represents Microsoft, so please ensure that your published plan is complete, free of typographical errors, and that content is in the correct sequence.";var Nx="This plan has been submitted to be localized",nB="The plan is complete and proofread",rB="Thank you for submitting your official plan for localization.",iB="Mark as completed",aB="Milestone",sB="Add milestone",lB="Edit milestone";var cB="New milestone",dB="Days to milestone:",uB="1 milestone",pB="{numberOfMilestones} milestones";var mB="Milestone completed";var gB="Move to";var fB="Please confirm all milestones have a title and days to complete. You may need to expand each milestone.";var hB="Mark as complete?",_B="Do you want to mark it complete? Once you mark it as complete, you won't be able to review it again.",bB="Welcome!",vB="To start this plan, you have to share your plan progress data with the creator of the plan. The data that will be shared is: the dates that you start and complete the plan and how many items of the total you have completed at any point in time. Your data will be associated with your public Learn username.",yB="Do you agree to share your progress?",xB="Yes, I agree to share my progress",TB="If you would like to receive useful emails to guide and encourage you through your Plans journey, please go to your Profile Settings page and provide a contact email for notifications.",wB="Save all items in this plan as a new",SB="Please sign in to add this to your plan.",EB="You created a plan",CB="You edited a plan",AB="You completed a plan",kB="You started a plan",PB="You don't have any plans yet.",MP="A learner group with this name exists already. Please enter a different name";var IB="Reported plan",LB='A concern has been reported on this plan and it is currently under Microsoft review. Please refer to our <a href="/legal/termsofuse">Terms of Use</a> for more information.',RB="We use AI to help you create a personalized plan.";var DP="Redeem your code now.";var MB="It looks like you have already redeemed this code.<br/>Go to your achievements page to view your achievements.";var DB="This code has hit its maximum.<br/>If you feel you are getting this message in error, please contact your instructor.",NB="We cannot find this code in our system. Please contact your instructor.";var $B="Copy Link";var UB="Enter your code to add your achievement(s) to your profile";var NP="We could not redeem your code at this time. Please try again.";var OB="Add your achievement(s) to your profile";var qB="Redeem",$P="Redeem your code";var 