large. File size cannot exceed five megabytes.";var _4="{account} already has a profile",b4="You have reached your account limit",v4="No more than five school or work accounts can be linked to one profile. Please remove one account and try again.",y4="{account} linked",x4='To access your Learn profile, you must be able to sign in using at least one of the login accounts listed below. You may add up to five work or school login accounts <figure class="image is-24x24 display-inline-block"><img alt="" aria-hidden="true" src="https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/media/profile/aad-user.svg"/></figure>. Adding a work or school account allows you to share your learning progress data with your organization and take advantage of any organizational exam discounts. We strongly recommend adding a personal Microsoft login account <figure class="image is-24x24 display-inline-block"><img alt="" aria-hidden="true" src="https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/media/profile/msa-user.svg"/></figure> to your profile. This ensures that you maintain access to your learning history and credentials regardless of your employment or academic status. Only one personal login account is allowed.',T4="Don\u2019t lose your data, add your account to profile",w4="You already have a linked account in the same organization",S4="Remove this account?",E4="Removing this account will delete its data from your Learn profile and stop the associated organization from receiving your Learn data. Note that your Learn profile will not be deleted.",C4="{account} removed",A4="Add login account",k4="Please add another account and try again.";var P4=`You can only link accounts that don't have a registered profile. Please select a different account or see our <a href="https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/training/support/troubleshooting#user-content-account-linking">troubleshooting guidance <span class="docon docon-navigate-external" aria-hidden="true"></span></a> for more details.`;var I4="Connected certification profile",L4="connected with certification profile";var R4="Other Learn login accounts",M4="You are adding a school or work account ({account}) to your profile. You understand and acknowledge that we may share your results and activities with your organization. You may choose to unlink this account at any time and your organization will stop receiving your learning progress data.",D4="You have linked this account already",N4="{account} is a personal account. Please select a school or work account.",Hp="Login account management";var Bx="MCID",$4="You need at least one account linked to your profile.",U4="No accounts added",O4="Only one account per organization is supported.",q4="You can only have one personal account linked",F4="Profile is currently being merged",H4="You can refresh the page to check the merge status.";var z4="Select account",zP="Please select a different account",B4="Shared information (like name or picture) will keep the info from Profile 1.",Y4="There is already a certification profile connected to this profile",V4="In order to continue, please contact customer support to remove the current certification profile to proceed.",G4="Your data will be <strong>merged into Profile 1</strong>.",j4="<strong>Editable information</strong> like your display name and interests can still be changed later.",BP="Notify me when merging is complete",W4="Merging profiles can take several minutes. We'll let you know when the process is complete. When you opt-in to this update, we may also send you personalized recommendations, helpful tips, or Q&A notifications.",Q4="You'll get notifications at {email}.",K4="Your email is not currently set to receive notifications and will not be enrolled after the merge.",J4='<a href="https://learn.microsoft.com/training/support/faq?pivots=profile">Learn more</a> about merging profiles.',X4="This profile has been locked",Z4="This profile is currently locked and is being merged with another profile. Please sign-in to a different profile.",YP="Retry merge",VP="Terminate merge",eY="Here's what will happen",tY="Merge complete",oY="Profile 1",nY="Profile 2",rY="You can refresh the page to check the merge status.",iY="Profile merge record not found",aY='Unable to find your profile merge. Please refresh the page. If the problem is still there, please contact <a href="https://learn.microsoft.com/training/support/troubleshooting#report-feedback">customer support</a>.',sY="A previous merge attempt is preventing this action",lY="One of the profiles you are trying to merge is currently being merged with another profile. Please log into both profiles to check the status.",cY="You're combining two Microsoft Learn profiles.",dY="Would you like to combine your learning data into one profile?",uY="Merging your data is permanent and cannot be undone, but all your learning progress including achievements, skills, and certifications will be combined in one place.",pY="Your profiles have been successfully merged.",mY="We ran into a problem merging your source profile (username: {sourceUser}) to your destination profile (username: {destinationUser}).",gY="Some of your data might have been merged in the process, so it is expected if you find some data disappearing from your source profile and appearing on your destination profile.",fY="You can choose one of the following actions:",hY="<b>{terminateMergeText}</b>: It will stop and quit the merge process. You will be able to use both profiles as usual and can trigger a new merge at any time. The data that already merged will remain on your destination profile.",_Y="<b>{retryMergeText}</b>: It will re-run the merging process for you once more. Your source profile will be locked during the merging process.",bY="Merging in progress. It may take several minutes to complete.",vY="Your merge has been terminated.",yY="Clicking 'Accept and continue' will begin the merging process. You can still use the profile you are currently signed-in with, but your other profile will be locked.",xY="We